OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool School of Tropical
OL,4,AMedicine warns of potential
OL,5,Aredundancies
OL,6,
OL,7,FPotential job losses are being
OL,8,Fconsidered at the Liverpool School of
OL,9,FTropical Medicine (LSTM) as it seeks
OL,10,Fsavings of about #8m this year.
OL,12,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,13,Fsaid a voluntary severance process had
OL,14,Falready taken place and that
OL,15,F"significant redundancies" were now
OL,16,Fbeing considered.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
