OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool School of Tropical
OL,4,AMedicine warns of potential
OL,5,Aredundancies
OL,6,
OL,7,FLSTM, a globally recognised research
OL,8,Finstitution, is seeking savings of
OL,9,Faround #8m this financial year, with
OL,10,Fsimilar savings planned over the
OL,11,Ffollowing two years. The union claims
OL,12,Fstaff have not been given a proper
OL,13,Fexplanation of the plans.
OL,15,FLSTM said it faced "some very difficult
OL,16,Fdecisions" but was "committed" to
OL,17,Fworking with unions to agree an
OL,18,Fapproach that worked for staff and
OL,19,Ftheir members.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
